        "type": "text",
        "text": "<i>Lunularia cruciata</i> is a primitive plant. Its body consists of a flattened sheet of photosynthetic tissue called a thallus.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 10
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Fig. 5.1 shows <i>L. cruciata</i> with two different types of reproductive structure, labelled <b>A</b> and <b>B</b>, on its surface.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 10
        }
      },
      {
